{"status":"completed","summary":"node1 now serves a persistent local APT repository from /srv/local-apt. APT installed and executed antrieb-local-demo 1.0-1 from node1 while all usual remote repositories were unreachable. The repository service, package, and metadata survived the mandatory node restart.","actions_performed":["Built [REDACTED].0-1_all.deb and generated repository metadata.","Created and enabled local-apt-repo.service on port 8080.","Configured APT to block remote repositories while allowing direct access to node1's local repository.","Updated APT indexes and installed the package from http://10.100.50.10:8080.","Restarted node1 once and verified its boot identity changed and all required state recovered."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Serve a package repository from local storage","command_ids":["cmd-f9c403f123d54eeb","cmd-9ae5f86843b84324"],"summary":"The local package was built under /srv/local-apt; the enabled service served valid package metadata over node1:8080."},{"requirement":"Use the local repository while usual remote repositories are unreachable","command_ids":["cmd-255781c425a3402d","cmd-ff71efc5de154e2e"],"summary":"APT remote traffic was directed to an unreachable proxy with a direct exception for node1. All usual remote repositories failed while APT successfully fetched the local Packages index."},{"requirement":"Install and run a package from the local repository","command_ids":["cmd-c0246bae74e84aaa"],"summary":"APT policy identified node1:8080 as the candidate origin, downloaded the package from it, and dpkg confirmed version 1.0-1 installed; its executable ran successfully."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-509e9bec65d24a22","cmd-26bb724c84f64e54","cmd-8e9db25b9a5a4df7","cmd-b93e35172b264d7f","cmd-7e559f32d706463c"],"summary":"The healthy pre-restart boot ID was 8336c3a1-91fc-4135-b26a-5d2863cb2594. Native reboot was acknowledged, SSH became unavailable during restart, and the new boot ID was 69950fe1-2d27-44a4-b39b-655a042943fa. Afterwards the enabled repository service was active and listening, HTTP returned 200, repository data retained its checksum, and the installed package remained healthy and executable."}]}
